train | Classes train inside Anvilmar.
complete The Troll Cave | Frostmane Troll Whelps in the cave west of Grelin.
complete 1599 Beginnings [class=Warlock; race=Gnome] | Frostmane Novices around the troll camps drop Feather Charms.
