accept 282 Senir's Observations
accept Scalding Mornbrew Delivery | Nori Pridedrift at Grelin's camp. Deliver fast; the brew cools.
turnin Scalding Mornbrew Delivery | Durnan Furcutter inside Anvilmar.
accept Bring Back the Mug
accept 3361 A Refugee's Quandary
turnin Bring Back the Mug
complete 3361 A Refugee's Quandary
accept Supplies to Tannok [optional] | Hands Springsprocket stands at the tunnel too.
turnin 282 Senir's Observations | Mountaineer Thalos at the tunnel out of the valley.
turnin 3361 A Refugee's Quandary
accept 420 Senir's Observations
turnin 420 Senir's Observations | Senir Whitebeard in Kharanos.
turnin Supplies to Tannok [optional] | Tannok Frosthammer inside the Thunderbrew Distillery.
