complete Stocking Jetsteam | Boars and bears south of Kharanos.
complete The Grizzled Den | Wendigos in the cave south of Kharanos.
complete Beer Basted Boar Ribs | Crag boar ribs and Rhapsody Malt (buy the malt from Ragnar Thunderbrew's distillery bar).
