turnin Tools for Steelgrill | Beldin Steelgrill at Steelgrill's Depot, east of Kharanos.
turnin Bitter Rivals | The barrel stands inside the Thunderbrew Distillery.
accept Return to Marleth
turnin Beer Basted Boar Ribs
accept The Reports
