accept The Public Servant
accept Those Blasted Troggs! | Foreman Stonebrow, Gol'Bolar Quarry.
complete Those Blasted Troggs! | Troggs in the quarry.
complete The Public Servant | Troggs inside the quarry mine.
turnin Those Blasted Troggs!
turnin The Public Servant
turnin The Reports [optional] | Senator Barin Redstone in Ironforge - do it if you go to Ironforge to train.
turnin Shimmer Stout | Mountaineer Barleybrew guards the tunnel to Loch Modan.
accept Stout to Kadrell
accept The Lost Pilot | Pilot Hammerfoot, near the North Gate Pass.
turnin The Lost Pilot
accept A Pilot's Revenge
complete A Pilot's Revenge | Mangeclaw prowls nearby.
turnin A Pilot's Revenge
level 11
note [class=Warrior,Hunter,Priest,Warlock] | Level 10 class quests in Kharanos and Ironforge (priests and warlocks also ride the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind). They teach spells you want now.
accept 6064 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf] | Grif Wildheart, Kharanos. Needs level 10.
complete 6064 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf] | Use the Taming Rod on a Large Crag Boar.
turnin 6064 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf]
accept 6084 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf]
complete 6084 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf] | Use the Taming Rod on a Snow Leopard.
turnin 6084 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf]
accept 6085 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf]
complete 6085 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf] | Use the Taming Rod on an Ice Claw Bear.
turnin 6085 Taming the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf] | Tame Beast.
accept 6086 Training the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf]
accept 1679 Muren Stormpike [class=Warrior] | Granis Swiftaxe, the warrior trainer in Kharanos. Needs level 10.
accept 5637 Desperate Prayer [class=Priest; race=Dwarf] | Maxan Anvol, the priest trainer in Kharanos. Needs level 10.
travel Ironforge [class=Warrior,Hunter,Priest,Warlock]
turnin 6086 Training the Beast [class=Hunter; race=Dwarf] | Belia Thundergranite, Hall of Arms. Beast Training.
turnin 1679 Muren Stormpike [class=Warrior] | Muren Stormpike, Hall of Arms.
accept 1678 Vejrek [class=Warrior]
accept 1715 The Slaughtered Lamb [class=Warlock] | Lago Blackwrench, Ironforge. Needs level 10.
travel Stormwind City [class=Priest,Warlock] | Take the Deeprun Tram from Tinker Town in Ironforge.
turnin 5637 Desperate Prayer [class=Priest; race=Dwarf] | High Priestess Laurena, Cathedral of Light. Desperate Prayer.
turnin 1715 The Slaughtered Lamb [class=Warlock] | Gakin the Darkbinder, Mage Quarter.
accept 1688 Surena Caledon [class=Warlock]
complete 1688 Surena Caledon [class=Warlock] | Surena Caledon carries the choker; she is in Elwynn Forest.
turnin 1688 Surena Caledon [class=Warlock] | Back to Gakin.
accept 1689 The Binding [class=Warlock]
complete 1689 The Binding [class=Warlock] | Use the Bloodstone Choker to summon the voidwalker, then defeat it.
turnin 1689 The Binding [class=Warlock] | Summon Voidwalker.
travel Ironforge [class=Priest,Warlock] | Tram back.
complete 1678 Vejrek [class=Warrior] | Vejrek's Head: Vejrek is with the Frostmane trolls in western Dun Morogh.
turnin 1678 Vejrek [class=Warrior] | Muren Stormpike, Ironforge. Defensive Stance.
level 12 [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | The Redemption quests need level 12: kill what is around you until you reach it.
accept 2997 Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Azar Stronghammer, Kharanos.
turnin 2997 Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Tiza Battleforge, Mystic Ward, Ironforge.
accept 1646 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Read the Tome of Divinity she gives you.
turnin 1646 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
accept 1647 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
turnin 1647 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | John Turner, on Ironforge's outer ring.
accept 1648 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
complete 1648 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | 10 Linen Cloth: humanoids drop it; you probably have some already.
turnin 1648 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
accept 1778 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
turnin 1778 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Tiza Battleforge.
accept 1779 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
turnin 1779 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Muiredon Battleforge, Mystic Ward.
accept 1783 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
complete 1783 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Use the Symbol of Life on Narm Faulk, by Helm's Bed Lake in eastern Dun Morogh.
turnin 1783 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Narm Faulk.
accept 1784 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
complete 1784 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | The Dark Iron Script drops from Dark Iron Spies close by.
turnin 1784 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Muiredon Battleforge, Ironforge.
accept 1785 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf]
turnin 1785 The Tome of Divinity [class=Paladin; race=Dwarf] | Tiza Battleforge. Redemption.
note Go through the South Gate tunnel into Loch Modan.
